
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>낭니 응원 리스트</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nanum+Gothic&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Nanum Gothic', sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #ffe5ec, #ffdada);
            padding: 30px;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .banner {
            display: block;
            max-width: 300px;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #c94f7c;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        input {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 500px;
            display: block;
            margin: 0 auto 30px;
            padding: 14px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            border: none;
            font-size: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }
        ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        li {
            background: #fff0f5;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            margin: 10px 0;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            font-size: 17px;
            color: #5a2a41;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <img src="banner.jpg" alt="낭니 배너" class="banner">
    <h1>❤️ 낭니 응원 리스트 ❤️</h1>
    <input type="text" id="search" placeholder="응원곡을 검색하세요...">
    <ul id="list">
        <li><span>Bounce</span><span>100</span></li><li><span>사인</span><span>101</span></li><li><span>Whistle</span><span>102</span></li><li><span>호시탐탐</span><span>103</span></li><li><span>슈퍼바구</span><span>2999</span></li><li><span>3만</span><span>3000</span></li><li><span>사랑하는랑플단</span><span>4268</span></li><li><span>5만</span><span>5000</span></li><li><span>VIP</span><span>10000</span></li><li><span>VVIP</span><span>20000</span></li><li><span>GOD</span><span>30000</span></li>
    </ul>
    <script>
        const search = document.getElementById('search');
        const listItems = document.querySelectorAll('#list li');
        search.addEventListener('input', () => {
            const keyword = search.value.toLowerCase();
            listItems.forEach(li => {
                li.style.display = li.textContent.toLowerCase().includes(keyword) ? '' : 'none';
            });
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
